  "question": {
    "text": "A line makes angles <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></math> with the coordinate axes. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></math>",
